You feel the van rumble along. At first it stops and starts, likely due to traffic, but after several minutes the journey becomes smoother.
<br><br>
It's hard to judge how much time passes, locked away in darkness. The car comes to a stop, and the engine falls silent. You hear many voices. 
The <<person2>><<person>> throws the boot open. <<Hes>> not alone. A gang of <<people>> stand beside <<him>>, watching you.
<br><br>
Your gasp snaps the air. "What do you—"
<br><br>
"We know exactly who you are, <<lass>>. Word gets around when someone survives four untested pills in a week without seizures, spasms, or organ failure. And walks around looking healthy." 
The gloved hand slides along your jaw, tilting your head as though examining the curve of a gemstone and strips you naked. "Healthy is valuable."
<br><br>
A quiet whistle hears then. "Imagine the sessions we could run... better yet, sell <<phim>>!"
<br><br>
The <<person3>><<person>> drags you from the boot. You get a glimpse of your surroundings before the <<people>> close in.

<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	You see long grass and wild flowers in the light of a nearby building. It's too dark to make out anything more, but you're somewhere outside town.
<<else>>
	You're on top of a hill, beside an old building. A rocky plain of grass and wild flowers stretches out in all directions. You're a long way from town.
<</if>>
<br><br>
The gang shove you towards the building, and through its doors.
